#: src/onboarding.glade:63
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Setup fit!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:82
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Perimus! UH⟧ nunc activum est in hoc computatro. Conare facere quodlib"
"et facere soles habere tesseram typum pro signo authenticitatis, sicut"
" mandatum currit cum sudo. Si keyring auto- recludam, aperiens aperien"
"s conventum tuum keyring vel KWallet etiam sponte in login.\n\nUH⟧ Con"
"figurator postea aperire potes ut occasus provectiores mutare vel exem"
"pla addita addere. Press Conclusio infra claudere hanc fenestram et ap"
"erire UH⟧ Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.glade:130
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"UH⟧ login keyring vel KW⟧ utens vultum tuum authenticas statim reserar"
"e potest, ne password suggerat post colligationem in."

#: src/onboarding.glade:142
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Admitte automatic keyring / KWallet reserans"

#: src/onboarding.glade:184
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Adfirmare password"

#: src/onboarding.glade:216
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Profecta certitudo consilium"

#: src/onboarding.glade:235
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Propter mutationum angulorum, distantiarum, et aliorum factorum faciei"
" par est, numquam prorsus simile est cum condita facie exemplar. In ha"
"c pagina quam stricte UH⟧ esse debet, constituere potes."

#: src/onboarding.glade:274
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Ieiunium"

#: src/onboarding.glade:290
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Plus quamquam par concedit; \nsed accelerat evagationem valde."

#: src/onboarding.glade:329
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "libratum"

#: src/onboarding.glade:345
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Relative tamen celerius deprehenduntur; \nsed ne longius tu log."

#: src/onboarding.glade:384
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Secure"

#: src/onboarding.glade:400
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Tutius est paullo tutior optio; \nsed multo amplius tollet signo authe"
"nticitatis incisionem"

#: src/onboarding.glade:443
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Addit ad exemplar vultus"

#: src/onboarding.glade:462
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Ut signo authenticitatis munito te UH⟧ servandum exemplar vultus tui u"
"t te cognoscat oportet. Scan puga pyga infra premet ut satus a faciali"
"s scan."

#: src/onboarding.glade:564 src/onboarding.glade:655
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Vestibulum webcam"

#: src/onboarding.glade:581
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
